    <summary>Exports chosen folders or individual messages from one Outlook data file (.pst or .ost) to PDF, HTML or TXT on the local PC, a PST to PDF converter that runs without Outlook.</summary>
    <description>This package installs a PST to PDF converter for Windows that turns messages from a saved Outlook archive into PDF, HTML or TXT files. It suits an admin who keeps .pst and .ost exports from departed staff on a file server and has to produce readable copies on request, without setting up Outlook profiles for people who no longer work there.

![PST to PDF Converter screenshot 1](https://download.softorbits.com/files/pkg-img/pst/pst-v1-open.png)

## How to use PST to PDF Converter Software

1. Load one archive with Open PST, or drop a .pst or .ost file on the window.
2. Expand the folder tree and tick what should be exported.
3. Open a folder to see its messages, and select one to read it in the preview pane.
4. When you need specific mail, filter by From, To, Subject or Body and run Search inside the current folder.
5. Go to the Convert tab, pick the output format and the inline images option, and switch between checked folders and selected messages.
6. Set the destination and click Start.

Trial note: an unregistered copy works as a limited free trial for testing on real mail. A license lifts those limits.

![PST to PDF Converter screenshot 2](https://download.softorbits.com/files/pkg-img/pst/pst-v1-read.png)

## Convert PST to PDF by folder or by message

Two export modes cover most requests. Checked folders sends everything under the ticked branches, which fits a request such as all mail from Sent Items. Selected messages takes only the rows highlighted in the list, which fits a filtered search result. Before a PST to PDF run starts, a counter states how many messages will be written.

## Save Outlook emails as PDF: what each file contains

- From, Date, To and Subject placed ahead of the body, for HTML mail too.
- The message body rendered from HTML, or plain text when that is all the message has.
- Inline images when that checkbox is on.
- Dates in UTC, since the archive keeps no sender offset.

![PST to PDF Converter screenshot 3](https://download.softorbits.com/files/pkg-img/pst/pst-v1-pick.png)

## Who it is for

- IT staff who hold mailbox exports of former employees and answer legal or HR requests.
- Records teams that need to save Outlook emails as PDF before a mailbox is retired.
- Offices that roll the tool out to several PCs with Chocolatey and process archives where Outlook is not installed.

## Trial and license

The package installs the free trial of a commercial program, and full use of this PST to PDF converter requires a license. Lifetime, 1-year and business licenses are offered, and any of them removes the trial limits. Details are on the [PST to PDF Converter Software](https://www.softorbits.net/pst-to-pdf-converter/?utm_source=chocolatey&amp;utm_medium=package) page.

## FAQ

### How do I convert a PST file to PDF?

Open the archive, tick folders or select messages, choose PDF on the Convert tab and click Start. The files appear in the destination folder you set.

### Is a PST file the same kind of file as a PDF?

No. A PST is an Outlook data store that holds many messages and folders, while a PDF is a page document meant for reading and printing.

### Can PST files be converted to formats other than PDF?

Yes, this program also writes HTML and TXT. Pick the format on the Convert tab before you press Start.
